          <h2>Thoughtful formulas, rooted in the Southwest.</h2>
          <p>Sunbleach draws inspiration from ingredients associated with the region and pairs them with familiar skincare staples. The fictional formulas are imagined as vegan and cruelty-free, with a focus on hydration, comfort, and daily sun protection.</p>
