        </div>
        <div class="feature-panel">
          <h3>Made for a dry-climate routine</h3>
          <p><strong>Hydrate:</strong> humectants such as glycerin help attract water to the skin.</p>
          <p><strong>Support:</strong> emollients and barrier-supporting ingredients help soften skin and reduce moisture loss.</p>
